    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3654,
      "y": 254.825,
      "width": 799,
      "height": 299,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "autoResize": false,
      "strokeColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "SET TIME ZONE 'Asia/Seoul';\nSET max_parallel_workers_per_gather = 0;\nEXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS, COSTS OFF)\nSELECT sum(amount) FROM orders WHERE date(created_at) = '2026-07-01';\n\nAggregate (actual time=54.847..54.852 rows=1.00 loops=1)\n  Buffers: shared hit=7353\n  ->  Seq Scan on orders (actual time=19.151..54.570 rows=9600.00 loops=1)\n        Filter: (date(created_at) = '2026-07-01'::date)\n        Rows Removed by Filter: 990400\n        Buffers: shared hit=7353\n…\nExecution Time: 54.894 ms",
      "originalText": "SET TIME ZONE 'Asia/Seoul';\nSET max_parallel_workers_per_gather = 0;\nEXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS, COSTS OFF)\nSELECT sum(amount) FROM orders WHERE date(created_at) = '2026-07-01';\n\nAggregate (actual time=54.847..54.852 rows=1.00 loops=1)\n  Buffers: shared hit=7353\n  ->  Seq Scan on orders (actual time=19.151..54.570 rows=9600.00 loops=1)\n        Filter: (date(created_at) = '2026-07-01'::date)\n        Rows Removed by Filter: 990400\n        Buffers: shared hit=7353\n…\nExecution Time: 54.894 ms",
      "id": "plan-before-027-code",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1217161160,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 74082242,
      "groupIds": [
        "plan-before-024-group"
      ],
      "frameId": "plan-before-frame",
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790208000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "study": {
          "role": "code"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3630,
      "y": 586,
      "width": 847,
      "height": 44,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "autoResize": false,
      "strokeColor": "#64748B",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "SET 두 줄은 실험 조건이다. 계획을 읽기 쉽게 병렬 실행을 껐고 COSTS OFF로 비용 추정을 뺐다. 병렬 실행을 끄지 않으면\n여러 프로세스가 나눠 읽는 계획(Gather 아래 Parallel Seq Scan)이 나오고 Buffers 합은 같은 7,353이다.",
      "originalText": "SET 두 줄은 실험 조건이다. 계획을 읽기 쉽게 병렬 실행을 껐고 COSTS OFF로 비용 추정을 뺐다. 병렬 실행을 끄지 않으면\n여러 프로세스가 나눠 읽는 계획(Gather 아래 Parallel Seq Scan)이 나오고 Buffers 합은 같은 7,353이다.",
      "id": "plan-before-028-text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1038978194,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 1294849416,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "plan-before-frame",
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790208000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "study": {
          "role": "note"
        }
      }
    },
